<title>UKRAINE: Hryvnia edged down to 1.824 from 1.82 per dlr in K.</title>
<headline>Hryvnia edged down to 1.824 from 1.82 per dlr in K.</headline>
<dateline>KIEV 1996-11-01</dateline>
<text>
<p>The hryvnia edged down to 1.824 per dollar on the Ukrainian Interbank Currency Exchange from 1.82 at the previous session.</p>
<p>				    November 1	  October 31</p>
<p> Hryvnia rate to dollar	  1.824		  1.820</p>
<p> Volume traded		  $11.050 million	  $20.100 million</p>
<p>--Kiev newsroom, +380 44 229 2264</p>
